The cost for the next level of a DU will increase after each purchased level. There is currently no known maximum level for DU, but Dilation Upgrade 4 (DU4), DU5 and DU9 effects eventually softcap.

The effect per level of all DU are increased by 10% (x1.10) when the player completes [[Achievements|{{Keyword|ach|Ach. 129}}]]. DU1, DU2 and DU3 effect per level can be increased by allocating {{Keyword|dtp|DTP}} to Dilation Tree Upgrades TOP-1, MIDDLE-1 and BOTTOM-1 respectively.

